  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1359655/description_37d2dc60-f5c6-420f-a101-9d4b44f9d7c3.png\"><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\">掌握<strong>Tokustar</strong>的力量，這位傳說中的外星生物蘊含宇宙級的強大實力！</span><br><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\">此擴充模組將Tokustar帶入你的Minecraft世界——化身為他，釋放足以匹敵天體存在的毀滅性力量與能力。</span></p>\n<h3><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><strong>生存模式獲取方式</strong><strong>:</strong></span></h3>\n<p><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\">Tokustar並不容易獲得。</span><br><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\">等待你的Omnitrix進入<strong>最終階段</strong>的<strong><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">自我毀滅</span></strong>&nbsp;&mdash; 當它開始閃爍<strong>橙色與白色</strong>時。</span><br><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\">在關鍵時刻，迅速<strong>卸下核心</strong>。你會發現Omnitrix發生了變化……全新的、強大的存在——通往<strong>Tokustar</strong>的道路就此展開。&nbsp;</span></p>\n<h3><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><strong>指令</strong><strong>: </strong></span></h3>\n<p><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">/scoreboard players set @s AlienEvo.SelfDestruct 109000</span>&nbsp; 等待數秒直至其開始持續閃爍並發出音效後，再卸下Omnitrix核心。</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">/alienautoadd @s stretchakln:tokustar</span> <span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\">將Tokustar加入下一個可用槽位。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><strong>相依模組：</strong></span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><strong><a style=\"color:#ecf0f1\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/threetag-palladium\" rel=\"nofollow\">Palladium</a></strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><strong><a style=\"color:#ecf0f1\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geckolib\" rel=\"nofollow\">Geckolib</a></strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><strong><a style=\"color:#ecf0f1\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/kubejs\" rel=\"nofollow\">KubeJS</a></strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><strong><a style=\"color:#ecf0f1\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/architectury-api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Architectury API</a></strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><strong><a style=\"color:#ecf0f1\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/alienevo\" rel=\"nofollow\">Alien Evolution v1.1.0</a></strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><strong><a style=\"color:#ecf0f1\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pehkui\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Pehkui</a></strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><strong><a style=\"color:#ecf0f1\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/rhino\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Rhino</a></strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><strong>Forge 版本 47.4.0</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n<h3><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\">程式編寫：<a style=\"color:#ecf0f1\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/gorrini/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Gorrini </a></span></h3>\n<h3><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\">素材製作：<a style=\"color:#ecf0f1\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/drstretch/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Stretch</a></span></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\">特別感謝</span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><a style=\"color:#ecf0f1\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://www.instagram.com/peter.coffe\" rel=\"nofollow\">PeterCoffe<strong>&nbsp;(圖示貼圖)</strong></a></span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><a style=\"color:#ecf0f1\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/yigitakln/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">yigitakln</span></a></span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#ecf0f1\">Babish</span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><a style=\"color:#ecf0f1\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/hibiquill/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Hibiquill</span></a></span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#ecf0f1\">Mc Charles</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
